{
  "version": 2,
  "updated": "2026-08-10",
  "doc": "Versioned argv-only gate ladder. All applicable detectors are combined. A hard failure stops later steps. Missing or uncollected required evidence is inconclusive, never pass. Commands run in a network-isolated Bubblewrap sandbox with a private home, a narrow read-only runtime allowlist, only the bound project and a private temporary directory writable on the host, and .git remounted read-only.",
  "rules": [
    "Commands are argv arrays and execute with shell disabled and a scrubbed environment.",
    "Every hard step is required for a pass.",
    "A missing runner or configured no-evidence exit is inconclusive.",
    "Unsandboxed execution requires the explicit --allow-unsandboxed-gates operator override.",
    "Project gate files require a run-bound project, an operator_reviewed marker, the explicit --allow-project-gates flag, and the exact raw-file SHA-256 through --project-gate-sha256. The hash binds exact configuration but does not authenticate a human; caller policy remains the authorization boundary."
  ],
  "detectors": [
    {
      "id": "node",
      "when_file_exists": "package.json",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "node-typecheck",
          "argv": ["npm", "run", "--silent", "typecheck"],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "node-lint",
          "argv": ["npm", "run", "--silent", "lint"],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "node-test",
          "argv": ["npm", "test", "--silent"],
          "hard": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "python",
      "when_file_exists": "pyproject.toml",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "python-compile",
          "argv": ["python3", "-m", "compileall", "-q", "."],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "python-lint",
          "argv": ["ruff", "check", "."],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "python-typecheck",
          "argv": ["mypy", "."],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "python-test",
          "argv": ["pytest", "-q"],
          "hard": true,
          "skip_exit_codes": [5],
          "skip_note": "pytest collected no tests"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rust",
      "when_file_exists": "Cargo.toml",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "rust-check",
          "argv": ["cargo", "check", "--quiet"],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "rust-clippy",
          "argv": ["cargo", "clippy", "--quiet", "--all-targets"],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "rust-test",
          "argv": ["cargo", "test", "--quiet"],
          "hard": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "go",
      "when_file_exists": "go.mod",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "go-build",
          "argv": ["go", "build", "./..."],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "go-vet",
          "argv": ["go", "vet", "./..."],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "go-test",
          "argv": ["go", "test", "./..."],
          "hard": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "brain",
      "when_file_exists": "scripts/audit_brain.py",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "brain-compile",
          "argv": ["python3", "-m", "compileall", "-q", "scripts", "sync_brain", "tests"],
          "hard": true
        },
        {
          "id": "brain-audit",
          "argv": ["python3", "scripts/audit_brain.py", "--json", "--report-only"],
          "hard": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
